{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 16, :comments ["<b>Those summoned to the assembly</b> — the vav is cut off and it is read קרואי, on account of Shelumiel son of Zurishaddai, who is Zimri son of Salu. And likewise in the assembly of Korah, קראי is written defective, and there the vav is missing entirely, because they were all wicked. But here, the others were righteous."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:20:57.617378260Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}